%section.eosc-navy
  .container
    .row.text-center
      .col-md-12.col-sm-12
        %h4
          We are the European Open Science Cloud (EOSC), an environment for hosting and processing research
          data to support EU open science
    .row.mt-5
      .col-md-3.col-sm-12
        %a.eosc-info{ href: "#{@search_base_url}/search/all_collection%3Fq%3D?q=*" }
          .eosc-info-icon
            = image_tag "landing_page/browse-marketplace.svg", alt: "Explore Discovery Hub"
          .eosc-info-texts
            .eosc-info-title Explore Discovery Hub
            .eosc-info-subtitle
              Browse through over 3 million research and innovation tools and services, thousands of datasets
              from a wide range of research domains from renowned European service providers.
      .col-md-3.col-sm-12
        %a.eosc-info{ href: user_dashboard_url }
          .eosc-info-icon
            = image_tag "landing_page/dashboard.svg", alt: "My EOSC Dashboard"
          .eosc-info-texts
            .eosc-info-title My EOSC Dashboard
            .eosc-info-subtitle
              Manage your research projects, access your activity history, and get resource recommendations.
      .col-md-3.col-sm-12
        %a.eosc-info{ href: "https://sandbox.eosc-beyond.eu/" }
          .eosc-info-icon
            = image_tag "landing_page/portal.svg", alt: "EOSC Core Innovation Sandbox"
          .eosc-info-texts
            .eosc-info-title EOSC Core Innovation Sandbox
            .eosc-info-subtitle
              Your pre-production environment for testing and staging within the EOSC Platform.
              It's designed for EOSC Core service providers, EOSC Exchange service providers,
              and EOSC Nodes to integrate seamlessly with EOSC.
      .col-md-3.col-sm-12
        %a.eosc-info{ href: "#{providers_dashboard_url}" }
          .eosc-info-icon
            = image_tag "landing_page/hub.svg", alt: "Providers Hub"
          .eosc-info-texts
            .eosc-info-title Providers Hub
            .eosc-info-subtitle
              A single platform for providers to onboard their organization into the EOSC portal,
              register and manage their resources and gain rich insights about the usage of their offerings.

%section.provider
  .container
    .row
      .col-md-4.col-sm-12
        = image_tag "landing_page/provider.svg", alt: "Are you a provider?"
      .col-md-8.col-sm-12
        %h3
          Are you a provider?<br>
          We can help you contribute to European research and innovation. Increase the visibility and usability of
          your resources across the European research community by onboarding them.
        %a.btn.btn-primary.mt-3{ href: "#{providers_dashboard_url}/becomeAProvider" } Onboard Resources

%section.questions
  .container
    .row
      .col-md-5.col-sm-12
        = image_tag "landing_page/questions.svg", alt: "Have any questions?"
        %h3 Have any questions?
        %p.lead
          Contact us if you encounter any<br>
          issues while using the website or<br>
          have any other suggestions that<br>
          we should know about.
      .col-md-2.col-sm-12
      .col-md-5.col-sm-12.contact-form
        %button{ id: "zammad-feedback-form" }
        :javascript
          $(function() {
            $('#zammad-feedback-form').ZammadForm({
          agreementMessage: '#{contact_form_message}',
          messageTitle: 'Report a problem/feedback',
          messageSubmit: 'Submit',
          messageThankYou: 'Thank you for your inquiry (#%s)! We\'ll contact you as soon as possible.',
          modal: false,
          targetGroupID: 15,
          attributes: [
            {
              display: 'Name',
              name: 'name',
              tag: 'input',
              type: 'text',
              id: 'zammad-form-name',
              required: true,
              placeholder: 'Your Name',
              defaultValue: '',
            },
            {
              display: 'Email',
              name: 'email',
              tag: 'input',
              type: 'email',
              id: 'zammad-form-email',
              required: true,
              placeholder: 'Your Email',
              defaultValue: '',
            },
            {
              display: 'Subject',
              name: 'title',
              tag: 'input',
              id: 'zammad-form-subject',
              required: false,
              placeholder: 'My subject',
              defaultValue: '',
            },
            {
              display: 'Message',
              name: 'body',
              tag: 'textarea',
              id: 'zammad-form-body',
              required: true,
              placeholder: 'Your Message...',
              defaultValue: '',
              rows: 7,
            }
              ]
            });
          });

